   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can't complain.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I get a library card or just keep buying books? I spend a fortune.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "block": "books.dlg22",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A library card is free and most libraries now lend e-books and audiobooks too, right from your phone.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Isaiah, did you add salt to this already?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 2.43,
   "block": "nq_home_028",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_home_028",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Isaiah"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "other",
   "text": "A pinch. Taste it first.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.82,
   "block": "nq_home_028"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The waiting lists are huge though.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 1.66,
   "block": "books.dlg22",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "True for new bestsellers. You can put holds on several at once, so something is always arriving.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I do like owning books.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "block": "books.dlg22",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then try a mix. Borrow first, and only buy the ones you loved enough to want to keep.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That would cut my spending in half, probably.",
